ZCL_COMMAND_READY_COMMAND(
    "app.adopt", "app", "", "Copy release",
    "Resolve the exact persisted release, display its verified publisher, "
    "identity, parent, changes and destination in a native confirmation "
    "window, and make a copy only after its local owner chooses Make my copy. "
    "The owner also authorizes a local publisher identity and a personal "
    "metadata successor; the original fork remains. With name:skycombat instead "
    "of release_root, verify installed source and ask before creating a local "
    "key, release or copy, then offer Build and Preview and a separate Keep. "
    "Cancel before copying creates neither "
    "a copy nor a key. Installed-source confirmation signs and saves locally; "
    "building and running require the next native choice. A later failure "
    "retains the copy receipt with continuation:failed.",
